{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_014Z7XqFUGhwwUeSefHVT5pp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS COMPLETE - All 3 Issues\n\nAll three critical issues stem from **Issue #1** as the root cause:\n\n1. **Amontillado as character** → Validator accepts \"Amontillado\" (wine) as a character\n2. **Montresor not narrator** → Cascades from #1 (Amontillado has more mentions)\n3. **Montresor missing profile** → NER only finds 1 explicit mention of \"Montresor\"\n\n**Fix Strategy:** Fix Issue #1 by improving the validator to reject non-person entities. This should cascade to fix Issues #2 and #5 automatically.\n\n## Phase 2: IMPLEMENT FIX\n\nBased on the root cause analysis, I'll fix the validator to better detect non-person entities. The fix should:\n1. Add explicit checks for common object categories (food, drink, objects)\n2. Improve the LLM validation prompt to emphasize rejecting objects/items\n3. Consider adding document title awareness to filter title words\n\nLet me implement the fix:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_read_input_tokens":76801,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":707,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2328c887-9860-4905-a9f6-317b02fbfb9a","uuid":"593c8f1f-bee0-4aa5-ae25-1c180d3c8c3c"}
